JNv_text","label":"ggbQzMRdJNv_text","default":"<p><span style=\"color:#122E0D;\">Your well-being is our priority. Each batch of Wellness Nest shilajit undergoes rigorous testing for purity, authenticity, heavy metals, and bacteria. Every jar has a tamper-evident seal and a lot number for peace of mind.</span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggAU6xzDMpH_text","label":"ggAU6xzDMpH_text","default":"Preserving Nature Power&nbsp;"},{"type":"html","id":"ggYjZeP458T_text","label":"ggYjZeP458T_text","default":"<p><span style=\"color:#122E0D;\">We use violet glass containers to preserve shilajit's natural benefits. These biophotonic containers protect it from light degradation, maintaining its potency and safety for longer.</span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggFRexdWWER_text","label":"ggFRexdWWER_text","default":"Quality You Can Trust"},{"type":"html","id":"ggqPuCnsjId_text","label":"ggqPuCnsjId_text","default":"<p><span style=\"color:#122E0D;\">We don't just say our shilajit is pure – we prove it! Every batch is meticulously tested and verified by independent labs. We even offer certificates of authenticity, so you can rest assured you're getting genuine, top-quality shilajit.</span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggiMCEyfIB4_text","label":"ggiMCEyfIB4_text","default":"From Peak To Perfection"},{"type":"html","id":"ggAV1JRB3K3_text","label":"ggAV1JRB3K3_text","default":"<p><span style=\"color:#122E0D;\">We source shilajit from select regions, hand-harvest it, and process it with pure water, avoiding harsh chemicals. Our GMP-certified and ISO-9001 compliant facilities ensure top safety and quality standards.</span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggmZR4UFyzd_text","label":"ggmZR4UFyzd_text","default":"Safety First"},{"type":"html","id":"ggFKgYsqGb6_text","label":"ggFKgYsqGb6_text","default":"<p><span style=\"color:#122E0D;\">Your well-being is our priority. Each batch of Wellness Nest shilajit undergoes rigorous testing for purity, authenticity, heavy metals, and bacteria. Every jar has a tamper-evident seal and a lot number for peace of mind.</span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg_PA40DTs5_text","label":"gg_PA40DTs5_text","default":"Preserving Nature Power"},{"type":"html","id":"ggjg6sfOgDU_text","label":"ggjg6sfOgDU_text","default":"<p><span style=\"color:#122E0D;\">We use violet glass containers to preserve shilajit's natural benefits. These biophotonic containers protect it from light degradation, maintaining its potency and safety for longer.</span></p>"}],
